X-WR-CALDESC:One calendar carrying Must Do\, Should Do and Going Above. Sub
 scribe to this instead of to each of them separately\, not as well\, or ev
 ery shared event arrives twice. General maintenance guidance\, not a subst
 itute for a licensed inspector\, contractor\, or your insurance policy ter
 ms.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/Chicago
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:P1D
