SUMMARY:Freeze prep\, protect the pipes
DESCRIPTION:Insulate exposed pipes\, cover spigots\, and confirm you know w
 here the main shutoff is.\n\nWhy: coastal homes are built for heat\, not c
 old. A hard freeze here bursts pipes that would be fine anywhere north of 
 us.\n\nDetails: https://gulfcoasthomemaintenance.com/guides/#dec-freeze-pr
 ep\n\nGeneral maintenance guidance\, not a substitute for a licensed inspe
 ctor\, contractor\, or your insurance policy terms.
